      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright 2010 American Academy of Allergy, Asthma & Immunology. Published by Mosby, Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "There is a growing need to standardize and validate outcomes for asthma research. In this review of asthma-related publications from the Journal in 2009, efforts to standardize methodology and reporting of translational research, the influence of the environment, therapeutics, and management of asthma are highlighted."
      },
